# Masala Factory Business Management System
# Supabase Configuration Template for Local Development & Vercel Deployment

# 1. Provide your Supabase project URL (e.g. https://xyz.supabase.co or https://xyz.supabase.co/rest/v1/)
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co

# 2. Provide your Supabase public Anon / Publishable Key
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=sb_publishable_...
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=sb_publishable_...
